{
  "dom_id": "step-455929",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Computing the Common Ratio",
  "problem": "Find the common ratio of the following geometric sequence.\n\n$$\n90, \\: -30, \\: 10, \\: -\\dfrac{10}{3}, \\: \\ldots\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "The common ratio $r$ of a geometric sequence is the constant we multiply by to get to the next term. In other words, it is the ratio of consecutive terms.\n\nTherefore, the common ratio for our sequence is\n\n$$\nr = \\dfrac{a_2}{a_1} = \\dfrac{(-30)}{90} = -\\dfrac{1}{3}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-455929\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"455929\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"1502\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-455929\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Computing the Common Ratio</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"455929\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n    